-9. **Density Update:**
-   - [S1, unofficial] (Byte-based):
-     $$
-     v_{\text{new}} = \text{clamp}\left(\left(\frac{v_{\text{old}}}{255} - \frac{s}{d} \cdot m\right) \cdot 255, 0, 255\right)
-     $$
-     where $v$ is the voxel scalar value, $s$ is `deformSpeed`, $d$ is distance, and $m \in \{-1, 1\}$ is `buildModifier` [S1, unofficial].
-   - [S2, unofficial] (Float-based):
-     $$
-     \text{density}[i] = \text{Clamp01}(\text{density}[i] + \text{delta} \cdot \text{falloff})
-     $$
